# Check every text file out with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says.
#
# The skills are parsed by line: SKILL.md frontmatter, the hashed generated
# files, and the bash gates. A Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true otherwise
# gets CRLF, including the copy a host clones when it installs the plugin.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
